nd metadata about the tiles are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TileJSON specification","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A vector tile source is added to an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" object along with one or more","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" objects. A vector style layer defines the appearance of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"any content supplied by the vector tile source.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/GeoJSON":{"title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","type":"topic","abstract":[],"kind":"article","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/PMTiles":{"title":"PMTiles","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/PMTiles","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/pmtiles","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Working with PMTiles"}],"role":"article","kind":"article"},"DDSCircleLayerExample.png":{"identifier":"DDSCircleLayerExample.png","type":"image","alt":null,"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/org.swift.MyProject\/DDSCircleLayerExample@2x.png","traits":["2x","light"]}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/FeatureStateVectorExample":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateVectorExample","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This example demonstrates feature state on a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource"},{"type":"text","text":", toggling the appearance of countries in a vector tileset as they are tapped."}],"role":"article","title":"Set Feature State (Vector Source)","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/featurestatevectorexample"}}}